<title>UK: Deutsche Hypo adds 100 mln marks to step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Hypo adds 100 mln marks to step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond announced</p>
<p>earlier by lead manager Dresdner Bank has been increased to 200</p>
<p>million marks from 100 million marks.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE HYPOTHEKEN BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY  **11.APR.01</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    20.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	**CALLABLE FROM 11.APR.97 AT PAR, WHEN COUPON THEN</p>
<p>		STEPS UP TO 5.0 PCT.</p>
<p>		OEFFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF SERIES 1152</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
